    "detailed_description": "<strong>TheBlackHouse</strong> is a single player horror game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><br>It is the 06.04.1992. You have saved for a long time to be able to afford a property for your small family. After the purchase contract is signed, you go to the house 2 days earlier to start the renovation, but everything goes differently than planned.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Contents</h2><br>- Find information about the house they bought. To do this, they have several options, from letters to VHS tapes.<br>- You want to get into a certain room? Then you need to find the appropriate key, code or security card.<br>- If the power goes out, you can try to reactivate the fuses, but remember that as you progress, the water in the basement rises. <br>- There are many paintings and objects that you can look at.<br><br> <br><strong>Can you manage to survive the nightmare and face your deepest fears?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game is being developed further.</h2>",
